{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11203210","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11203210","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1120321001:0":{"text":"음… 아르사 누나, 몸이 안 아파. 그리고… 배고파! 밥까지 먹고 싶어!","source_cn":"唔……阿尔萨姐姐，我现在好像舒服多了……而且肚子饿了！...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3BDB4AD8995201E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1120321002:1":{"text":"어머, 잘됐다. 너 입맛 없다고 그러더니, 드디어 음식을 먹고 싶은 거야? 금방 준비해 줄게!","source_cn":"太好了，你之前一直都没什么胃口，现在终于想吃东西了！我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8AABDE30BB6B7A8F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1120321003:1":{"text":"약효가 있는 것 같아. 금방 낫겠어.","source_cn":"看来那药剂有用，这孩子确实好起来了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA8610C7B02D1186A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1120321004:1":{"text":"거봐, 내가 그랬잖아! 이런 병은 금방 해결할 수 있다고. 뭘 그렇게 긴장하고 그래.","source_cn":"哎呀，我早就说过了，这种小问题，轻轻松松就能解决的。你...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9EDA6C19A6D46780","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1120321005:1":{"text":"잠깐만요! 스모키 씨, 묻고 싶은 게 있어요… 그 “비법”이라는 거… 대체 뭐였어요?","source_cn":"等等！阿熏，我有个问题想问你……你的那个“祖传秘方”…...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x158183D43A602AA2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1120321006:1":{"text":"그건… 말해주기 곤란한데…","source_cn":"这个……我可不太方便说啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x90602F2525C49141","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1120321007:1":{"text":"다들 알겠지만 이건 영업 비밀이라서 말이야. 혹시라도 새어나간다면, 내 밥줄이 끊기는 거라…","source_cn":"各位应该也明白吧，这种可是我们看家的本事，万一泄露出去...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A7F31789913804C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1120321008:1":{"text":"약속할게요, 절대 비밀로 할게요!","source_cn":"这个你放心，我们肯定不会说出去的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF40909F4EE24D0A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1120321009:1":{"text":"다만 너무 신기해서요… 분명히 저희랑 같은 약초를 썼는데, 그 “비법” 하나로 결과가 바뀌니까…","source_cn":"但是我真的很好奇……明明我们都用的同样的草药，为什么只...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC35EB9C185FB3EF0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1120321010:1":{"text":"음… 뭐, 얘기해주지. 다만 비밀로 한다는 약속은 꼭 지켜야 해!","source_cn":"哎呀，这……行吧，那我就偷偷告诉各位了，但你们千万不能...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x900E1275BC40D7B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1120321011:1":{"text":"다른 사람이 알면, 여간 귀찮아지는 게 아니라서 말이야!","source_cn":"如果其他人知道了，我真的会出问题的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x52104C36B838953F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:16:1120321011":{"text":"다른 사람이 알면, 여간 귀찮아지는 게 아니라서 말이야!","source_cn":"如果其他人知道了，我真的会出问题的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x52104C36B838953F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1120321012:1":{"text":"그 비법이란게… 사실은 내 혈액이야.","source_cn":"其实那个祖传配方，就是从我的血液。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x38A477B375E9D538","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1120321013:1":{"text":"당신의… 피요? 스모키 씨 피가 그렇게 대단한 거였어요?","source_cn":"是你的……血？你的血竟然这么厉害……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3673C862D61E379","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1120321014:1":{"text":"우리 미어캣들의 피는 태생적으로 독에 저항하지.","source_cn":"我们狐獴的血液，可以抗毒。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xED8836E214BDD8ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1120321015:1":{"text":"…그런 거였군요.","source_cn":"……原来如此。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A72E1CBA3E9583E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1120321016:1":{"text":"다만 포션을 만들 때마다 피를 뽑아야 하잖아요… 너무 힘들 것 같아요!","source_cn":"不过如果是这样的话，你做药剂的时候，岂不是要抽自己的血...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC0DA904B0D9669D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1120321017:1":{"text":"피 몇 방울 정도로 뭘 그러나. 내가 딸린 식구가 얼마…","source_cn":"还好还好，一点血而已，毕竟我还要养这么一大家子……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25FBDD1C2CC4625B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1120321018:1":{"text":"아, 그러니까, 내 말은 피 몇 방울로 사람을 구할 수 있다면야, 힘들어도 보람차단 뜻이지!","source_cn":"啊不，我的意思是，毕竟我的血可以帮助到其他人嘛，不辛苦...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4128DC8B1623966C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1120321019:1":{"text":"꼬마도 안정을 찾은 것 같으니, 이제 약은 더 안 먹여도 될 거야.","source_cn":"现在来看，这孩子的情况差不多已经稳定了，之后就不用再服药了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB7767B4C09033CAB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1120321020:1":{"text":"꼬마야, 함부로 아무거나 집어먹다간 또 고생하니까, 앞으로 음식은 꼭 조심해서 먹으라고!","source_cn":"但还是要注意饮食！可不能再随便把什么东西都放进嘴里了，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB6705AF3C8B2972","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1120321021:0":{"text":"네! 고마워요, 천재 약사 스모키님!","source_cn":"知道啦！谢谢天才药剂师阿熏先生！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x44C271575A09C0FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1120321022:1":{"text":"이번 일은 정말 고마웠어요. 당신이 아니었다면 어떻게 해야 했을지…","source_cn":"这次真的太感谢你了，阿熏。要不是有你，我还真不知道怎么...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x487F768DC7F3D957","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1120321023:1":{"text":"하하, 도움이 되어서 오히려 영광이야!","source_cn":"哎呀，小事小事！能帮到你们也是在下的荣幸啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A9FB1D7547A9E9A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1120321024:1":{"text":"트라이브 꼬마의 상태도 좋아졌으니, 이제 집으로 돌아가도 되지?","source_cn":"既然这小蛮血病都好的差不多了，我也是时候该回去了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD56F4BA33077E077","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1120321025:1":{"text":"그럼요! 제가 바래다 드릴게요!","source_cn":"当然当然！我送你回去吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x52290ECC8BFF2465","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"